"""
BCH Complex · INFECTION PREVENTION
Hardened Reference Framework (v2)
================================================================================

PURPOSE
    Keeps a specific user (or household) out of the wrong place at the wrong
    time — locations and moments where an exposure that is mild for most people
    can produce a severe, incurable, or fatal outcome for them. One call after
    waiver:

    1. Assesses objective environmental hazard at the place + time.
    2. Applies the user's own susceptibility (in-memory only) to produce a
       personalized risk of severe outcome and a forecast of when that line
       is crossed for them.
    3. In HOME mode, identifies in-home hazards and returns a concrete fix plan.
    4. Returns a PROBABILITY OF INFECTION for this user (a saturating estimate
       from their personalized exposure; the slope is an input, not an invented
       constant) alongside a clear recommendation:
         DO_NOT_GO  — personalized severe-outcome risk at this place/time
         SAFE_TO_GO — no elevated personalized risk, with certainty
         FIX_HOME   — home hazard(s) and how to remediate
    5. Notifies venue operators / public health when the public is at risk
       (lawful, non-protected data only). Device faults escalate to makers.
    6. Contributes only anonymous environmental features to the shared
       data + neural-net library (never the user's health) so every participant
       earns: data in $BTC, neural-net runs in $BCH.

PROVENANCE
    Draft (Claude) -> review (Google) -> hardening (Grok) -> merged, plus the
    probability-of-infection output. One file, a reference FRAMEWORK for a tech
    employee to build on: detection, personalization, the monetizable library,
    comms and billing.

PRIVACY (non-negotiable)
    Susceptibility (genetics, receptor profile, immune status, comorbidities,
    health_status, etc.) is the most protected data. It is used only in memory
    for this call to personalize risk, then fully purged. It is never stored,
    never logged, and never used as a training feature. A hash of protected
    data is still protected. Only allow-listed, non-protected environmental
    facts are retained.

PAYMENT
    Data units → $BTC
    Neural-net units → $BCH
    Verified emergency (signed attestation or confirmed high personalized risk) = free.
    Failed or insufficient request = zero charge.

DISCLAIMER
    Informational only. Not medical advice or diagnosis. Consult a qualified
    professional. AI-generated code may contain errors.
"""

